# Cloudflare Pages redirects and rewrites for sector0.pages.dev.
#
# The short installer URLs are the product's front door:
#
#     curl -fsSL https://sector0.pages.dev/sh | sudo bash
#
# They are internal 200 rewrites, not redirects: the response is the script
# itself, so the browser never sees a hop. Every target moved under /install/
# when the landing page, the installer and the verifier became one deployment.
# site/install/_headers matches the short paths as well as the real ones, so a
# rewritten request is still served as text/plain with nosniff.
